 "headHtml": "<!-- QBS-SCHEMA:START -->\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@graph\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"@id\": \"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/alp/ads-contract-mfg#faq\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What's the difference between private label and contract manufacturing?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Private label uses an existing, doctor-formulated product from the Praxera catalogue with your brand on the label. Contract manufacturing usually means producing to your own specification - your formula, your packaging, your positioning. Praxera supports both routes. Most brands start with private label and add custom work as they grow.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"How long does a custom product take?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"12 to 16 weeks from project kickoff to first production run. That covers formulation work, ingredient sourcing, stability testing, production scale-up and the first batch. Simpler formulations can move faster.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Where are the products made?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"In a US facility in Vermont that is FDA-registered and GMP certified to SQF and NSF 455-2 standards.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"What are the minimum order quantities?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"Most stock formulations have minimums in the low hundreds of bottles per SKU. Custom projects are quoted individually. Exact numbers come out of your consultation.\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"Question\",\n          \"name\": \"Who do I deal with day to day?\",\n          \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n            \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n            \"text\": \"One Praxera contact, from the first consultation through to reorders, with in-house design support for labels and sell sheets.\"\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>\n<!-- QBS-SCHEMA:END -->",
